id: pm-github-7c95
title: Keep reusable workflow operands out of executable positions in attestation scans
description: "Dependabot PR 135 exposes unsupported Bash forms in the canonical strict attestation scanner: array element assignments, split compound tests and dynamic case patterns are misread as executables."
